From 596804ef7f4e1e6572e8ff9e5eb4762db5ff20b3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "HT9045 Machine (V906)" <Claude_RDBC_02@honprec.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 11:14:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] PARAMSYNC-2 / NOTICE-DEFER-5: confirmed bugs from the review
 of 4e3f1bf / 0c22df0 (hourly bug loop).

1a WebMotorAccessLive.cpp W906_BootInitMotorTick (same line): ONE axis per call. Since 4e3f1bf it also runs on the main loop, and all
   18 InitMotors (~0.9 s of IO-thread round trips each) in one call froze the serve loop 16.5 s at 10:53 (oplog: RESET answered after
   16063 ms, HOME after 6203 ms, heater job starved).
1b same function (same line): an axis with no servo sample 20 s after motor power is skipped and logged, so the boot can finish;
   W906_ParamSyncTick (same line): a page-open request (Motor Test / Teach) no longer waits for the boot InitMotor.
1c EtherCAT/Pci1203MotorRoute.cpp SetSpeedParam (same line): a FRESH card read-back (newer than this route's last command and any other
   caller's write) wins over the route's own last write when judging the acc/dec ceiling -- Motor Test's Test Range / Rate InitMotor
   rewrites MaxAcc outside the route and the stale record skipped a needed raise (0x80000013).
2a tests/test_note_auth.cpp: the D026 pin follows the main-loop lambda (skip + the unchanged gate), + a pin that the skip is keyed by id.
2b tools/wb_serve.cpp (same lines): g_w906NoticeGatePassed is a set of COMMAND ids (unique, never reused), was the notice tag: a held ack
   consumed by another wait (ForwardShowErrorMessage / YesNo answer carried notifyAcks themselves) left the tag behind and the next PAUSE
   on the same notice skipped the auth gate; a second ack in the same wait overwrote the first.
Debug: wb_serve linked; Pci1203MotorRoute, WebMotorAccess, NoticeAck, D026_NoteAuth passed. Scan 0. W906_ParamSyncTick / the boot tick
have no unit test (live tick) -- check the op log at the next start: InitMotor (boot) lines one per pass, no SLOW pass > 2 s.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
